@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FA
  BorderColor #2F6FB5
}
[*] --> PENDING : user taps send;\nstored locally with clientMsgId
PENDING --> SENT : ACK {seq}\none tick
PENDING --> PENDING : no ACK: retry\nsame clientMsgId
PENDING --> FAILED : 7 days without an ACK
FAILED --> PENDING : manual resend\n(a new clientMsgId)
SENT --> DELIVERED : a recipient device's\nDELIVERED cursor passes seq\ntwo ticks
DELIVERED --> READ : a recipient's READ cursor\npasses seq
READ --> [*]
note right of SENT
  The tick is a promise: a majority of
  replicas held the message before the
  ACK left. Every later state is a cursor
  comparison, not a per-message record.
end note
@enduml
